Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you let AI write an email
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.96,0:00:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,to your boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Draft it? Absolutely. Send it without me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.95,0:00:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,reading it? Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.75,0:00:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A small but rather career-preserving distinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The exciting part and the awkward questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.95,0:00:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We make room for both on The
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,AI Edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.36,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sense of the AI stories shaping
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.94,0:00:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,your day. Follow The AI Edge wherever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.53,0:00:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,you listen.
